        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Robert Bozic, Larry Holmes\n- Places: Toronto, Canada, Madison Square Garden, Easton, Pennsylvania\n- Roles: professional heavyweight boxer, former professional boxer\n- Topics: boxing careers, boxing nicknames\n\nFacts:\n- Robert Bozic was born in 1950.\n- Larry Holmes was born on November 3, 1949.\n- Robert Bozic was a professional heavyweight boxer from Toronto, Canada, from 1970 to 1977.\n- In 1973, Robert Bozic fought Larry Holmes at Madison Square Garden and lost.\n- Larry Holmes was an American former professional boxer who competed from 1973 to 2002.\n- Larry Holmes grew up in Easton, Pennsylvania.\n- Larry Holmes was nicknamed the \"Easton Assassin\" because he grew up in Easton, Pennsylvania.",
